<p>当获得了 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Texture ID</code>后就可以用<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">openGL</code>来绘制了，这里推荐用 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">GLKView</code>来做绘制</p>

<div class="language-c highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><!-- <td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
